.th TRBAS I June/77
.sh NAME
trbas \*- translate DEC basic plus source to Unix format
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd trbas
<inputfilename >outputfilename
.sh DESCRIPTION
The changes made are :
.s3
.nf
	cr/lf is replaced by newline;
	lf/cr/null is replaced by _/newline.
.fi
.s3
.it Trbas
works as a filter.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
basicp (I)
.sh BUGS
This is a very primitive utility - no error checks are made.
More features are being added.
